@OrderFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Login
POST {{OrderFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@orderflow.dev",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### List orders
GET {{OrderFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
